# =====================================================================
# DATA — defensive. Raw price data is exchange-licensed and must NEVER
# be committed. It lives in the project-local store
# (C:\Users\jaek9\Documents\LaggingTruth\Moving-Averages-Follow-Price),
# which is outside this repo entirely. These patterns are a second
# line of defense in case a data file is ever copied into the repo
# by mistake. data/ itself is documentation-only (SOURCES.md, pull.py).
# =====================================================================
data/*.csv
data/*.xlsx
data/*.xls
data/*.parquet
*.csv
!analysis/outputs/*.csv

